			"notes": "#### New stuff\n\n- add a hotkey to toggle an items favourite state\n  - works like the offhand hotkey and can be configured to only work in containers\n  - closes https://github.com/technicfan/DontDropIt/issues/1\n- drop delay animation now accounts for patial ticks the it is smoother than before\n\n#### Fixes\n\n- drop delay counter was not reset on slot change\n- drop key counter was not reset correctly\n  - fixes https://github.com/technicfan/DontDropIt/issues/2"
		},
